# =====================================================================
# WHY THESE CVEs ARE IGNORED:
# =====================================================================
# These vulnerabilities are present in the base Debian 12 packages 
# (like util-linux, sqlite, gzip, etc.) inherited by our Python image.
# 
# We are ignoring them temporarily because:
# 1. They currently have no official "Fixed Version" patch released 
#    yet by the upstream Debian package maintainers.
# 2. Our code is secure, but base OS layers often have unpatched 
#    edge-case bugs waiting for backports.
# 
# Once Debian releases updates for these packages, we will remove 
# them from this file and let our `apt-get upgrade` patch them automatically.
# =====================================================================

